{"id":"1e50676dbd9fe9bc","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-alt-relations.md","title":"交替与空间/时间关系","display":"thm-alt-relations — 交替与空间/时间关系","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-alt-relations","aliases":["29-thm-alt-relations"],"display":"thm-alt-relations — 交替与空间/时间关系","depends_on":["[[29-df-resource-constructibility]]","[[29-df-alt-complexity]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 2.25, p.36, DjVu scan 51; proof pp.38–40, scans 53–55; constructibility p.26, scan 41","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及配置图模拟证明结构已核对","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-alt-relations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-alt-relations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-alt-relations — 交替与空间/时间关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1bf4bc889b65fb80\" href=\"?note=1bf4bc889b65fb80\" title=\"29-df-resource-constructibility\">29-df-resource-constructibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8a781a879eb2b5bf\" href=\"?note=8a781a879eb2b5bf\" title=\"29-df-alt-complexity\">29-df-alt-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 2.25, p.36, DjVu scan 51; proof pp.38–40, scans 53–55; constructibility p.26, scan 41"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及配置图模拟证明结构已核对"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为固定有限关系输入词汇；下述所有机器类均在此词汇、同一编码与同一输入论域上比较。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为结构域大小。资源界以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(\\cdot)\">\\(O(\\cdot)\\)</span> 计；输入带只读并支持随机访问，所有分支停机。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}\\)</span>；两类取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1bf4bc889b65fb80\" href=\"?note=1bf4bc889b65fb80\" title=\"29-df-resource-constructibility\">29-df-resource-constructibility</a> 的形式定义。</li>\n<li>单参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s],\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]\">\\(\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s],\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8a781a879eb2b5bf\" href=\"?note=8a781a879eb2b5bf\" title=\"29-df-alt-complexity\">29-df-alt-complexity</a> 对当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的简写，确定性资源类也按同一词汇限制。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\geq2\\;\\bigl(t(n)\\geq n\\land s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\bigr)\">\\(\\forall n\\geq2\\;\\bigl(t(n)\\geq n\\land s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\bigr)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ATIME},\\mathrm{ASPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{ATIME},\\mathrm{ASPACE}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8a781a879eb2b5bf\" href=\"?note=8a781a879eb2b5bf\" title=\"29-df-alt-complexity\">29-df-alt-complexity</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{DTIME},\\mathrm{P},\\mathrm{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{DTIME},\\mathrm{P},\\mathrm{PSPACE}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{ATIME}[(t(n))^k] = \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{DSPACE}[(t(n))^k,\\tau]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{ATIME}[(t(n))^k] = \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{DSPACE}[(t(n))^k,\\tau]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\mathrm{ASPACE}[s(n)] = \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{DTIME}[2^{k \\cdot s(n)},\\tau]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\mathrm{ASPACE}[s(n)] = \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{DTIME}[2^{k \\cdot s(n)},\\tau]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\mathrm{ASPACE}[\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil] = \\mathrm P[\\tau]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\mathrm{ASPACE}[\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil] = \\mathrm P[\\tau]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\mathrm{ATIME}[n^k] = \\mathrm{PSPACE}[\\tau]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\mathrm{ATIME}[n^k] = \\mathrm{PSPACE}[\\tau]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.25，印刷页 36、扫描页 51。已核对陈述及 pp.38–40 的模拟证明结构：交替时间可用确定性深度优先搜索同阶空间模拟；非确定性空间的路径中点模拟给出反向多项式资源对应；交替空间的指数个配置可确定性枚举，反向使用计算表局部核验。可构造性沿用 p.26 的资源界约定，域大小与编码长度在固定词汇下的多项式关系用于第一式的多项式并集。未把单参数简写混用为不同输入模型上的类。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-resource-constructibility","status":"resolved","id":"1bf4bc889b65fb80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-resource-constructibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-alt-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-alt-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-resource-constructibility","status":"resolved","id":"1bf4bc889b65fb80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}$；两类取 [[29-df-resource-constructibility]] 的形式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-alt-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"单参数 $\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s],\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]$ 采用 [[29-df-alt-complexity]] 对当前 $\\tau$ 的简写，确定性资源类也按同一词汇限制。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-alt-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ATIME},\\mathrm{ASPACE}$ (see [[29-df-alt-complexity]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{DTIME},\\mathrm{P},\\mathrm{PSPACE}$ (see [[29-df-complexity-classes]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"O(\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s],\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\geq2\\;\\bigl(t(n)\\geq n\\land s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\bigr)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ATIME},\\mathrm{ASPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE},\\mathrm{DTIME},\\mathrm{P},\\mathrm{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{ATIME}[(t(n))^k] = \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{DSPACE}[(t(n))^k,\\tau]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\mathrm{ASPACE}[s(n)] = \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\mathrm{DTIME}[2^{k \\cdot s(n)},\\tau]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\mathrm{ASPACE}[\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil] = \\mathrm P[\\tau]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alt\\text{-}relations} \\vdash \\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\mathrm{ATIME}[n^k] = \\mathrm{PSPACE}[\\tau]","display":true}],"bytes":3005,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"